            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Each JSON file contains a time series of measurements. Each entry includes AR device data with time, x position, y position, z position, pitch, roll, and yaw. Vicon motion capture data includes x, y, and z positions for each marker. \n\nExplanation of tests and data are included in the README.md."
